      "result": "All 19 checklist items have been tested and recorded.\n\n**Summary: 14 PASS / 5 FAIL**\n\nCore browsing, searching, filtering, job posting, deletion, and application flows work well. The five failures:\n\n- **FT-18** — No job editing exists at all; dashboard cards only offer \"view applications\" and \"delete\", and `/employer/edit-job/:id` returns a 404.\n- **CS-10** — Job publishing validation is incomplete: industry, employment type, location and skills can all be left empty, and a salary range of min 150 / max 90 is accepted without any feedback.\n- **CS-11** — Duplicate applications with an already-used email for the same job are accepted silently.\n- **IX-19** — No persistence whatsoever; created jobs, submitted applications and deletions all revert to seed data on reload (localStorage/sessionStorage empty).\n- **CT-20** — Newly created jobs and applications display \"Yesterday\" instead of \"Today\", an apparent off-by-one date bug.",
